        {
          "text": "Umazisile namuhla uJehova ukuthi unguNkulunkulu wakho, uhambe ezindleleni zakhe, ugcine izimiso zakhe, nemiyalo yakhe, nezahlulelo zakhe, nokulalela izwi lakhe.",
